{"kind":"stack","id":"s-sun-eyes","title":"Protecting our eyes from the sun","theme":{"background":"#fffbeb","foreground":"#1e293b","font":"system-ui, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Can light from the sun harm your eyes?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Yes, it can","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"No, never","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Only at night","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Ultraviolet (UV) light"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"An invisible part of sunlight. It can burn the skin and damage the eyes, even on cloudy days."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sunglasses"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What is the best way to protect your eyes from the sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Wear sunglasses that block UV light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Look straight up at the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Squint hard for a long time","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Is it safe to look directly at the sun during a sunny day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"No, it is not safe","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Yes, for a few seconds","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which of these is a safe way to watch a solar eclipse?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Use special eclipse glasses","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Use ordinary sunglasses","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Look through a pair of binoculars","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"Sunscreen"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-e","content":"A cream or lotion you rub on your skin. It helps block UV light and protects your skin from burning."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Which of these helps protect your eyes outdoors on a bright day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"A wide-brimmed hat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Running with your eyes closed","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"Staring at shiny water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You are at the beach on a very sunny day. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Put on sunglasses and a hat","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Stare at the bright sea without protection","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Your eyes stay comfortable and safe all afternoon. Well done for choosing protection!"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-t","content":"Your eyes feel sore and watery. Next time, remember to protect your eyes from the sun."},{"type":"button","id":"c10-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the lesson on sun and eyes!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Light from the sun can harm your eyes. Wear sunglasses, a hat and use eclipse glasses to look at an eclipse."}],"actions":[]}}
